----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCALAR ELECTRONIC COUPLINGS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
units = meV
diagonal = zero by definition
pairwise_lowdin = [H_ij - 0.5*(H_ii + H_jj)*S_ij] / [1 - S_ij^2] after diagonal-overlap normalization
full_multistate_lowdin = off-diagonal elements of S^(-1/2) * H * S^(-1/2) in the complete supplied MEBF space

